{"title":"Steel Tariffs in Two Pictures","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/912895265/0/marginalrevolution~Steel-Tariffs-in-Two-Pictures.html","date":1739449136000,"content":"<p>Recall Principle 2 of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/three-simple-principles-of-trade-policy.html\">Three Simple Principles of Trade Policy</a>, <em>Businesses are Consumers To</em>o<strong>. </strong>Case in point, steel. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/JustinWolfers/status/1889101312005951570\">Justin Wolfer</a>s summarizes an <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://swh.princeton.edu/~reddings/pubpapers/ARW-May-2020.pdf\">analysis of Trump’s 2018 steel tariffs</a>:</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GjdvodcXEAA-5Kt?format=jpg&amp;name=900x900\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"507\" height=\"456\" /></p>\r\n<p>Going back further we have a <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://coxlydia.com/papers/cox_steel_tariffs.pdf\">good analysis</a> from Lydia Cox of the Bush steel tariffs. Even though the tariffs were temporary, they led to a rearrangement of supply chains which led to long-lasting declines in exports and employment in steel using industries.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Steel.png\" width=\"789\" height=\"482\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Steel.png 828w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Steel-300x183.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Steel-768x469.png 768w\" /></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/steel-tariffs-in-two-pictures.html\">Steel Tariffs in Two Pictures</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/912895265/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/912895265/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/912895265/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fpbs.twimg.com%2fmedia%2fGjdvodcXEAA-5Kt%3fformat%3djpg%26amp%3bname%3d900x900\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/912895265/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/912895265/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/912895265/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/steel-tariffs-in-two-pictures.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/steel-tariffs-in-two-pictures.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/steel-tariffs-in-two-pictures.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/steel-tariffs-in-two-pictures.html#comment-160874839\">In reply to agammamon.   Spending focus? Do you expect USAID to ...</a> <i>by Leo</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/steel-tariffs-in-two-pictures.html#comment-160874838\">In reply to Mco.   That is a rather odd way on introducing ...</a> <i>by